{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013CdsYu936hJuoHYThUyaJM","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tname: tone-guide\n3\tdescription: House style for release notes and changelog entries. Use when drafting or editing release notes.\n4\t---\n5\t\n6\t# tone-guide\n7\t\n8\tWhen you write or edit release notes:\n9\t\n10\t- Lead with what changed for the reader, not with what the team did.\n11\t- One idea per bullet. Keep bullets under 20 words.\n12\t- Use plain words: \"fixed\", \"added\", \"removed\". Avoid \"leveraged\" and \"utilized\".\n13\t- Name the user-visible effect of a fix, not the internal cause.\n14\t- If a change could surprise someone, say so first and say what to do about it.\n15\t- Never promise dates for future work.\n16\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3b0d77b4-f44f-43f2-898a-d02142f55f91","uuid":"48eb7dcc-b2d6-4ada-a81d-cbf7ba6934f9","timestamp":"2026-10-04T03:08:55.224Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/tmp/h-XySudi/skills/tone-guide/SKILL.md","content":"---\nname: tone-guide\ndescription: House style for release notes and changelog entries. Use when drafting or editing release notes.\n---\n\n# tone-guide\n\nWhen you write or edit release notes:\n\n- Lead with what changed for the reader, not with what the team did.\n- One idea per bullet. Keep bullets under 20 words.\n- Use plain words: \"fixed\", \"added\", \"removed\". Avoid \"leveraged\" and \"utilized\".\n- Name the user-visible effect of a fix, not the internal cause.\n- If a change could surprise someone, say so first and say what to do about it.\n- Never promise dates for future work.\n","numLines":16,"startLine":1,"totalLines":16}}}
